  aciklama:
  - "Bir uyar\u0131 ile a\xE7\u0131l\u0131yor fincan\u0131n. {{isim}}, \xE7\u0131ng\u0131rakl\u0131
    bir y\u0131lan g\xF6r\xFCyorum telvelerinde. Bu y\u0131lanla kar\u015F\u0131
